# POLLY, two small things: Band's PRESETS steps through your grooves only (empty memory places passed over: none on a
# fresh boot, so one back from Pop's Groove A, the first style's, stays there), and a Setup knob turned to the value
# it has marks nothing unsaved.
wait 300
tap SEQ
expect page 6
expect song1_style1 33
turn PRESET -1
wait 200
expect song1_style1 33
# ---- Setup: MIDI out is on; turned further on, nothing to save; off, something
tap GLO
expect knob2_is_on 1
expect dirty 0
turn K2 1
wait 100
expect dirty 0
expect lit_SAVE 0
turn K2 -1
expect knob2_is_off 1
expect dirty 1
